{"term": {"label": "親", "variants": []}, "source": {"id": "4A", "url": "https://ctext.org/mengzi/li-lou-i", "title": "離婁上", "description": "孟子曰：「離婁之明，公輸子之巧，不以規矩，不能成方員：師曠之聰，不以六律，不能正五音；堯舜之道，不以仁政，不能平治天下。今有仁心仁聞而民不被其澤，不可法於後世者，不行先王之道也。\n「故曰，徒善不足以為政，徒法不能以自行。《詩》云：『不愆不忘，率由舊章。』遵先王之法而過者，未之有也。聖人既竭目力焉，繼之以規矩準繩，以為方", "occurrences": 17, "data": null}, "network": {"directed": false, "multigraph": false, "graph": {}, "nodes": [{"form": "事", "id": "事"}, {"form": "人", "id": "人"}, {"form": "侮", "id": "侮"}, {"form": "先", "id": "先"}, {"form": "受", "id": "受"}, {"form": "命", "id": "命"}, {"form": "大", "id": "大"}, {"form": "失", "id": "失"}, {"form": "存", "id": "存"}, {"form": "實", "id": "實"}, {"form": "師", "id": "師"}, {"form": "恥", "id": "恥"}, {"form": "悅", "id": "悅"}, {"form": "本", "id": "本"}, {"form": "盡", "id": "盡"}, {"form": "聞", "id": "聞"}, {"form": "親", "variants": [], "id": "親"}, {"form": "身", "id": "身"}, {"form": "道", "id": "道"}, {"form": "順", "id": "順"}, {"form": "養", "id": "養"}], "edges": [{"weight": 1.2383742310432684, "source": "悅", "target": "事"}, {"weight": 2.1138429683971682, "source": "悅", "target": "親"}, {"weight": 0.6787584431078457, "source": "悅", "target": "道"}, {"weight": 2.336986519711378, "source": "侮", "target": "人"}, {"weight": 2.847812143477369, "source": "侮", "target": "順"}, {"weight": 0.3220834991691132, "source": "親", "target": "人"}, {"weight": 2.2192034840549946, "source": "親", "target": "事"}, {"weight": 0.27329333499968134, "source": "親", "target": "道"}, {"weight": 1.7083778602890038, "source": "親", "target": "受"}, {"weight": 0.22677331936478853, "source": "親", "target": "大"}, {"weight": 1.7083778602890038, "source": "親", "target": "失"}, {"weight": 1.3719056236677911, "source": "親", "target": "聞"}, {"weight": 0.8329091229351039, "source": "親", "target": "身"}, {"weight": 1.0152306797290584, "source": "親", "target": "本"}, {"weight": 1.0152306797290584, "source": "親", "target": "實"}, {"weight": 1.5260563034950492, "source": "親", "target": "順"}, {"weight": 1.526056303